unicipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"102"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[138.8507843017578,36.477413177490234]}}],"display_comment_original":"東吾妻町には、地域の由緒を示す案内板や石碑を探す余地がある。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場、古墳や貝塚に関わる場所が見え、八幡要害跡、岩櫃城跡、上ノ久保城跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["木檜三四郎","小林宗作","菅谷勘三郎","渡仲三","角田勝次"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["旧樽沢トンネル","岩櫃城","コニファーいわびつ","上郷岡原遺跡","吾妻渓谷（吾妻峡）","郷原遺跡","四戸古墳","岩下祇園祭"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%B1%E5%90%BE%E5%A6%BB%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11519179","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q5365799","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11619377","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11561889","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11630778","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11352503","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11384349","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11368435"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"東吾妻町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110862402","wikidata_qid":"Q1203419","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%B1%E5%90%BE%E5%A6%BB%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}